data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","item_id":"rs_0c4782c01617f547016ac93f7a6e0887d2bf492331dbc4fe3b","output_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Planning server implementation**\n\nI need to implement simple server-rendered HTML forms that support standard text boxes and buttons—no need for a Single Page Application (SPA). I'll use a synchronous SQLite database with logic for trimming projects and sending alerts for invalid submissions. Additionally, I'll handle HTML escaping, use project rows in a div, and set up a GET action form for projects. I’ll also configure health checks and testing for node integration with the temporary database outside the repo. I have enough time for this!"},"sequence_number":101,"summary_index":0}

