xt","text":"**Planning server implementation**\n\nI need to implement simple server-rendered HTML forms that support standard text boxes and buttons—no need for a Single Page Application (SPA). I'll use a synchronous SQLite database with logic for trimming projects and sending alerts for invalid submissions. Additionally, I'll handle HTML escaping, use project rows in a div, and set up a GET action form for projects. I’ll also configure health checks and testing for node integration with the temporary database outside the repo. I have enough time for this!"}]},"output_index":0,"sequence_number":102}

